    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "arching one's body backwards (like a shrimp)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "幼い頃から新体操を習っていた彼女は、今でも軽々とエビ反りができる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「うわっ、危ない！」飛んできたボールを避けようとして、思わず体がエビ反りになった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "準備運動をせずにいきなりエビ反りをして、腰をグキッとやってしまった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "holding out one or both hands and arching one's body backwards like a shrimp (to represent being overwhelmed by someone's power)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「ひええ、勘弁してください！」借金の取り立て屋に凄まれ、男は椅子の上でエビ反りになって震えた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "歌舞伎役者が「成田屋！」という掛け声と共に、見事なエビ反りの見得を切った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「おっとっと……」あまりの剣幕で詰め寄られ、気圧されて思わずエビ反り気味に後退した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
